      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Most labeled payments have few neighbors; a long tail of high degree is consistent with mixers and splitters. Degree is a sparse structural cue that still exists on later, unlabeled weeks, unlike a neighbor's illicit tag.\n",
        ""
