        }
      ],
      "id": "split"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "The holdout is a later labeled slice, not a random fold. Its illicit rate is higher than the earlier window, so a model that merely copies the training prevalence will rank poorly. Metrics on this slice are the project's check that ranking still works after the training period.\n",
        ""
      ],
      "id": "efa80e6d"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 6. Feature selection\n",
        "\n",
        "Near-duplicate transaction features are removed. The correlation filter is estimated on the training window only, so later weeks do not enter the selection.\n",
        ""
      ],
      "id": "s6"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Drop highly correlated features using the training window; retain payment degrees.\n",
        "\n",
        "corr = train_fit[feature_cols].corr().abs()\n",
        "upper = corr.where(np.triu(np.ones(corr.shape), k=1).astype(bool))\n",
        "drop_cols = [col for col in upper.columns if any(upper[col] > 0.95)]\n",
        "reduced_cols = [c for c in model_feature_cols if c not in drop_cols]\n",
        "\n",
        "print(f\"Highly correlated feat_* to drop: {len(drop_cols)}\")\n",
        "print(f\"Features: {len(model_feature_cols)} → {len(reduced_cols)}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "def quick_auc(cols, name):\n",
        "    lr = LogisticRegression(\n",
        "        class_weight=\"balanced\", max_iter=1000, random_state=42, n_jobs=-1\n",
        "    )\n",
        "    lr.fit(train_fit[cols].astype(float), train_fit[\"label\"])\n",
        "    auc = roc_auc_score(\n",
        "        train_val[\"label\"],\n",
        "        lr.predict_proba(train_val[cols].astype(float))[:, 1],\n",
        "    )\n",
        "    print(f\"LogReg ({name}): Val AUC = {auc:.4f}\")\n",
        "    return auc\n",
        "\n",
        "auc_all = quick_auc(model_feature_cols, \"all features\")\n",
        "auc_reduced = quick_auc(reduced_cols, \"corr filtered\")\n",
        "\n",
        "corr_cols = reduced_cols\n",
        "submission_cols = list(corr_cols)\n",
        "print(f\"LogReg val all vs corr-filtered: {auc_all:.4f} vs {auc_reduced:.4f}\")\n",
        "print(\"corr-filtered features:\", len(corr_cols))\n",
        ""
      ],
      "execution_count": 60,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
